<title>RUSSIA: St Petersburg to auction 100 bln rbls munis May 28.</title>
<headline>St Petersburg to auction 100 bln rbls munis May 28.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Russia 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The City of St Petersburg will offer 100 billion roubles of 728-day GGKO municipal bonds on May 28, the city's Finance Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction follow:</p>
<p>    Series number			     SU36003GSPM0</p>
<p>    Issue volume				100 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations			     100,000 rbls</p>
<p>    Issue date				  May 28, 1997</p>
<p>    Tenor					 728 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date			     May 26, 1999</p>
<p>--St Petersburg Newsroom, +7812 219 9209</p>
</text>
